xt": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: John, your dad likes to play golf, right?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Yes, most weekends with his best friend, Warren. I don't like golf. Why?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, what about a new set of golf clubs as a present?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Golf clubs are too expensive! I'm a poor student.<br/>", "id": 1, "time": "400", "image": "engenn2le05ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Be honest, John ... you have more money than me! Buy him a polo shirt? A golf club, maybe?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Those are cheaper suggestions.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Where can we get the best deal?<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Vanessa says that the bicycle shop has a lot of sports equipment.<br/>", "id": 2, "time": "20700", "image": "engenn2le05ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class = \"strong\">Sally</span>: Let's look for a present there and go to the coffee shop near the park.<br/>\n<span class = \"strong\">John</span>: Great idea! Time for a cappuccino! Shopping is hard work.", "id": 3, "time": "36250", "image": "engenn2le05ob04re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn2le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn2le05ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Out and About", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "So Many Choices", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 5, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A1.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about free time activities or personal likes/dislikes in  communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Talking About Sports", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you talk about sports, you can use nouns and verbs. You can talk about what you like or don't like.  ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can express likes and dislikes with different phrases. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expressing Likes \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Expressing Dislikes\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I like ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I don't like ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I like to play soccer. <br/> I love to play a lot of sports. <br/>I don't like to play sports.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I love ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I hate ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I love to play a lot of sports. <br/> I hate to play tennis! </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I don't like to play hockey.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I don't like golf. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I really like to go swimming.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Basketball and volleyball are sports I really like. \u0000", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "suggestion", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an idea or thought", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Those are good suggestions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when you talk about sports.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cheap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not expensive", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: These shirts are cheap.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "honest", "type": "name"}, {"content": "truthful", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Be honest, John. You have more money than me!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "golf club", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the stick used to play golf", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Golf clubs are too expensive!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "polo shirt", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a shirt with a collar", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The polo shirt is red.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "friend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "someone you have a close relationship with", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I play golf with my friend, Warren.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "best", "type": "name"}, {"content": "first; top", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You are the best golfer!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "expensive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "costing a lot of money", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Golf clubs are too expensive.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le05ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Find a flyer or website for a sports store.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Look at the shirts. Choose two shirts to buy. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What color are they? How much do they cost? Are they cheap or expensive?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Complete the table below. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cel